! ELEGANT_GPU_ENABLE_TAPERAPE=0 (from suite.json) keeps TAPERAPE on the CPU; the lattice is aperture-taperape's.
D: DRIF,L=0.10
TE: TAPERAPE,L=0.04,ASTART=0.02,AEND=0.016,BSTART=0.014,BEND=0.011,DX=4e-4,DY=-3e-4,TILT=0.05,STICKY=1
TF: TAPERAPE,L=0.06,ASTART=0.017,AEND=0.017,BSTART=0.012,BEND=0.009,RESOLUTION=1e-8
Q: QUAD,L=0.2,K1=0.5,ORDER=2
CELL: LINE=(D,TE,D,Q,TF,D)
RING: LINE=(3*CELL)
